  exerciseNumber: 02
  exerciseName: EquipmentVisualDoesntHide
  exerciseTitle: Equipment Visual doesn't hide
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/64202446
  exerciseText: Selecting a different Equip should hide the previous one but it doesn't
  hintText: How is the disable logic working? What exactly is it disabling? Add some
    logs on the equipSO to verify
  solutionText: The disable logic is not using this.equipSO when disabling, it is
    using equipSO which is the new one, not the previous one
